      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The current yt-dlp version in VRChat as of writing this:\n\n```\n\nPS C:\\Users\\linda.LINDALAP\\AppData\\LocalLow\\VRChat\\VRChat\\Tools> .\\yt-dlp.exe --version\n\n2026.07.04\n\n```\n\n`2026.07.04` in VRChat uses `android_vr` to fetch format 18 from YouTube at the moment, but all `android_vr` formats with client version 1.65.10 user-agent are returning `403 Forbidden` when downloaded. Thus no YouTube playback in VRChat with this one.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
